  m_Text: 'Look at a food close up and press E. Hot dog, coffee, burrito, gyro and
    pretzel work at once, one at a time. The rest go in your stash (top of the screen,
    up to 5 each): ice cream on F, bread on G, bagels and pizza by themselves. In
    the gym, food comes back 2 s after it''s eaten.'
